30:["$","p",null,{"className":"_resolution_1t4cy_275","children":[["$","em",null,{"children":"Interpretation."}]," ","The cluster is the inferential unit for exact randomization."," ",["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","em",null,{"children":"Scope."}]," ","Cluster length, sensor, deployment and observed covariates must not create label-dependent laws within a stratum."]}]]}]
